    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A World Type: the vanilla overworld terrain, but its biomes come from this list. Each biome sits at a climate point and every column takes the nearest one, so msm_sample_worldgen:amber_woods fills the mild, humid areas and seven vanilla biomes the rest. The nether and the end are the vanilla ones, using the vanilla dimension types. Choose it under More > World Type when creating a world."
